{"title":"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_17\">Problem 17</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 17\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The formula <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/c/68ce6730632b852c4248fc343da6fa50b61217e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=8 \\times 10^{8} \\times x^{-3/2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"160\" height=\"16\" /> gives, for a certain group, the number of individuals whose income exceeds <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> dollars. \nThe lowest income, in dollars, of the wealthiest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/7/557a9700315ffdc6da28316197f148da6ee2a3ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$800$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> individuals is at least:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/5/5d5d6022b9c895d6816cc8ab1a5dd5ecd637facd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 10^4\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 10^6\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 10^8\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 10^{12} \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 10^{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"443\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plug <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/7/557a9700315ffdc6da28316197f148da6ee2a3ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$800$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/7/557a9700315ffdc6da28316197f148da6ee2a3ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$800$\" width=\"26\" height=\"12\" /> is the number of people who has at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> dollars.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/5/58578afcec1d2d7a59d2038e119b387c58a8b4a5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[800 = 8 \\times 10^{8} \\times x^{-3/2}\\]\" width=\"170\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/4/824210d688a2019dfb05c15e5b1de91701457b9e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10^{-6} = x^{-3/2}\\]\" width=\"99\" height=\"16\" />\nIn order to undo raising to the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/b/ebbc60fdf37f15079cc1212df9413c08b0bd7671.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{3}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"25\" height=\"37\" /> power, raise both sides to the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/f/1efac12079e5b21957c06321b7b6526ad85c13d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"29\" height=\"38\" /> power.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/0/8806d8a03a50beeac6ebd3cc572f5382921b3a4e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(10^{-6})^{-2/3} = (x^{-3/2})^{-2/3}\\]\" width=\"190\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/3/073b7d95aa47a63a06dca539a11bb59b29225427.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x = 10^4  \\text{ dollars}\\]\" width=\"113\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>The answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME\" title=\"1960 AHSME\">1960 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1960 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1960\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem